        "nobel_worthiness": "Optical lattice clocks transformed precision timekeeping and tests of fundamental physics, while revealing new ways to probe atomic structure and variation across space and time.",
        "attribution": "Katori and Ye independently established complementary approaches that shaped the field; the credit is strong, though the broader development involved many laboratories.",
        "maturity": "The methods have been replicated internationally and reached exceptional performance, making the achievement mature.",
