        "nobel_worthiness": "A convincing demonstration of fractional charge and anyonic statistics would test a distinctive prediction of quantum mechanics in a profound way.",
        "attribution": "Leinaas and Myrheim helped formulate the foundational idea, while Fève, Heiblum, and Manfra represent important experimental tests; the listed contributions span different parts of the story.",
